--- !u!1001 &2011510528
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1357480952}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 150186496989610373, guid: 0abc28e9b72f78947863f8d0b60c3b65, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _content
      value: "[Excerpt from a tattered journal entry\u2014Minh\u2019s handwriting]\n\nThey
        call it 'Development.' You take a piece of paper that has seen too much or
        too little, and you drown it in chemicals until a shape appears. If you leave
        it in the dark for too long, the image never finds its form. It stays a mystery.
        But if you pull it out too early into the harsh light, the details vanish\u2014burned
        away by a world that doesn't care about the nuance of the shade.\n\nI\u2019ve
        spent so long being afraid of the 'Click.' The sound of a moment ending.
        I thought that by staying in the darkroom, I could keep her alive. But a
        photograph isn't a person. It\u2019s just a ghost made of silver and light.
        Grandma didn't give me this camera to capture her death; she gave it to me
        so I wouldn't miss my own life. The shadow isn't my enemy. It\u2019s just
        the part of me that\u2019s afraid to see what the next frame looks like without
        her in it."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1063458325495393329, guid: 0abc28e9b72f78947863f8d0b60c3b65, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Mesh
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1954186017}
    - target: {fileID: 2475963954628228297, guid: 0abc28e9b72f78947863f8d0b60c3b65, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
