--- !u!1001 &9002877260154840967
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 141899439}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1028768586993904934, guid: 0655f48b095eb9442b8ff51f20b9e2b1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _content
      value: "<align=center><b><b><size=110%>THE LAST MEMORY</size></b></align>\r\n<align=center><b><b><size=100%>PHASE
        1: THE FIRST EXPOSURE</size></b></align>\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>PRE-STAGE
        UPGRADES</b></color>\r\n<i>(Located on the bench before entry. You may only
        choose <b>ONE</b>)</i>\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#00C8FF>Fisheye Optic:</color></b>
        Specialized camera lens providing a wider field of view and <b>Double Tracking
        Range</b> while aiming.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#00C8FF>Spectral Tuner:</color></b>
        An old radio modified to let you <b>Passively see the Shadow's silhouette</b>
        without using the camera.\r\n\r\n<voffset=0.5em><b><color=#00FFC0>THE OBJECTIVE</color></b>\r\nStand
        at the central table and <b>Hold <color=#C0C0C0>[E]</color></b> to fix the
        <b><color=#FF00FF>Fragment</color></b>. You must reach <b>100% Progress</b>
        to trigger the next phase.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>THE THREAT: THE SHADOW</b></color>\r\n\u2022
        <b><color=#C0C0C0>Manifestation:</color></b> He appears at random locations.
        While he is present, the <b>Fragment Progress is LOCKED</b>. He must be banished
        to continue.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Static Cues:</color></b> Listen
        for <b>Radio Static</b>. The sound is 3D\u2014it gets louder as you get closer
        or when looking directly at his position.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Invisibility:</color></b>
        Unless you have the <b>Spectral Tuner</b>, the Shadow is invisible to the
        naked eye. You must use the <b>Viewfinder <color=#C0C0C0>[Right-Click]</color></b>
        to see him.\r\n\r\n<color=#00FFC0><b>DETECTION & DEFENSE</b></color>\r\n\u2022
        <b><color=#C0C0C0>Red Indicators:</color></b> When you are near the Shadow's
        location, <b>Red Lines</b> will appear on-screen to guide your aim.\r\n\u2022
        <b><color=#C0C0C0>Polaroid Flash:</color></b> To banish him, center your
        cursor on his body and <b><color=#C0C0C0>[Left-Click]</color></b> to take
        a photo.\r\n\u2022 <b><color=#C0C0C0>Recovery:</color></b> Once banished,
        there is a short window of safety before he can reappear. Use this time to
        focus entirely on the Fragment.\r\n\r\n<color=red><b>!!! CRITICAL ADVICE
        !!!</b></color>\r\n<b>Do not lose your direction.</b> There are <b><color=#C0C0C0>Invisible
        Walls</color></b> at the map edges. Focus your movement on the inner arena;
        if you get stuck against a wall during a chase, your run <b>will</b> end.
        <b>Listen, Light, and Move.</b>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1819010857611080890, guid: 0655f48b095eb9442b8ff51f20b9e2b1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Mesh
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1187041235}
