--- !u!1001 &9106842050630725128
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1357480952}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 150186496989610373, guid: 0abc28e9b72f78947863f8d0b60c3b65, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _content
      value: "\"My dearest Minh,\r\n\r\nIf you are reading this, it means you\u2019ve
        finally come back to our park. I know how hard it has been for you to look
        at this bench without feeling the weight of that sunset.\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ve
        always had a way of capturing the world through your lens, but I feared you
        were using that camera to hide from the world rather than see it. Please,
        don't let that one moment\u2014the moment the light left my eyes\u2014be
        the only frame you keep in your heart.\r\n\r\nYou blame yourself for not
        being enough, for being 'broken' or 'depressed,' as you call it. But Minh,
        even a cracked lens can capture a beautiful sunset. The shadows you've been
        running from aren't there to swallow you; they are just part of the picture.\r\n\r\nForgive
        yourself for being human. Put the camera down for a moment, take a breath,
        and look at the sky. It's time to stop living in the Labyrinth of what was,
        and start seeing the light of what is.\r\n\r\nI am still here, in every golden
        ray and every rustle of the leaves. I love you, always.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Grandma\""
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1063458325495393329, guid: 0abc28e9b72f78947863f8d0b60c3b65, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Mesh
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1593497544}
    - target: {fileID: 2475963954628228297, guid: 0abc28e9b72f78947863f8d0b60c3b65, type: 3}
